@startuml
title BLE stack on ESP32

rectangle "Application\nsensor logic\ncommands\nproduct state" as APP
rectangle "Host\nGAP, GATT, ATT\nSMP, L2CAP" as HOST
rectangle "Controller\nLink Layer\nPHY\nradio scheduler" as CTRL
rectangle "2.4 GHz radio\nadvertising channels\nconnection events" as RADIO

APP -down-> HOST : ESP-IDF or NimBLE APIs
HOST -down-> CTRL : HCI boundary
CTRL -down-> RADIO : packets on air

note right of HOST
  GAP discovers and connects.
  GATT describes the data.
  SMP handles keys and encryption.
end note
@enduml
